{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Effulgence RPG: ASCII Animations Supporter Pack</strong> is a curated set of <strong>17 music-driven videos</strong> made entirely from text symbols. These clips document <strong>multiple stages of development</strong>\u00a0- early prototypes, mid-production builds, and near-final scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Includes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 short ASCII videos</strong> with original music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality files for viewing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Footage from <strong>different dev stages</strong>: raw prototypes --&gt; polished sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No gameplay content or advantages</strong>\u00a0- this is a purely cosmetic/collector\u2019s &quot;thank you&quot; pack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why this DLC</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support the indie development of Effulgence RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain access to rare visual moments showing how the ASCII-3D look and lighting grew over time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Notes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base game required</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Media content only, does not alter gameplay.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093000?t=1760621695","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093000?t=1760621695","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093000/3d5bc6e77d7d54a5f7c7dd4770537e40a09041c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760621695","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093000/3d5bc6e77d7d54a5f7c7dd4770537e40a09041c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760621695","categories":[{"description":"Sin